# Tamer mage loop: self recovery, veterinary supplies for the pets, self buffs and Flamestrike for the aspect proc.
# Needs: veterinary supplies (25750), reagents, potions, Create Food reagents or magic mushrooms.
# Template: Animal Lore, Animal Taming, Veterinary 120, Magery, Tracking 100, Resisting Spells, Meditation 80.
# Hotkeys: Drink Cure, Drink Heal, Drink Refresh, Drink Strength, Drink Agility, Drink Magic Resist,
#          Eat Magic Mushroom, > Smart Heal/Cure Self, > Greater Heal/Cure Self, > Interrupt, Cancel Current Target.
# Optional cooldown bars: heal pot, walk, reflect. A missing bar reads 0.
# Pets and targeting stay manual (summoner Z then V). The script never commands a pet.
# Warmode is the manual control window: Flamestrike, Bless, Arch Protection and Create Food stand down.
# Survival, Reactive Armor, Magic Reflection, veterinary supplies and potions ignore it.
# Tracking only warns, through the profile overheads. Meet a PK with combat/pvp (F4).
# Design and in-game checks: blueprint/open-items.html part 12.
#
# Shape
#   Each block reads the live state and acts on the spot, as in bard-necro-enhanced. Item uses
#   go through Razor's object delay queue and every block waits while that queue is busy. A
#   cast block waits out its own cast in a for 60 poll and cuts it at the emergency line.
#   Priority: survival, then Reactive Armor and Magic Reflection, then Flamestrike in a fight,
#   then Bless and Arch Protection after it.
#
# Input rules (wiki Combat Overview, blueprint/pvp.html part 5.B)
#   Potions and items go out while a spell is casting, but wait while a cursor is held:
#   drinking with a finished precast in hand cancels that spell. Casts need no cast, no cursor
#   and, through the optional walk bar, no movement, as in bard-necro-enhanced.

clearall
clearsysmsg
cleardragdrop
clearignore

if pvp
    overhead "[ script, blocked ]" 254
    stop
endif

# ####################################################################################
# # CONFIG
# ####################################################################################
# Optional script overheads. Essential warnings remain visible.
@setvar! config__chatty 1
# Journal diagnostics: startup, combat target changes, casts, veterinary supplies and gold drops.
@setvar! config__sysmsg 1
@setvar! config__use_potion 1
# Strength, Agility and Magic Resist potions while an enemy is engaged.
@setvar! config__use_stat_potions 1
# STR and DEX with the Greater potion on: your base plus 20. Below these the potion is drunk.
# Bless and the Strength and Agility spells, ours or an ally's, show the same icons as the
# potions but add less than its 20, so the stat is what tells the potion apart.
@setvar! config__str_potion 120
@setvar! config__dex_potion 100

# Veterinary supplies heal every pet within reach after the 5 second bandage time, and cure
# and resurrect at reduced odds (wiki Veterinary). Reach is 2 tiles plus 3 from the healing codex.
# The pets are picked once and kept in the profile. A full health pet is not healed, so the
# supplies are tried every cooldown__vet_kit while a picked pet is in reach.
@setvar! config__use_vet_kit 1
@setvar! config__vet_range 5
# Pets to pick: 1, 2 or 3. Three by default (two 2 slot pets and one 1 slot pet).
@setvar! config__pet_count 3

# Flamestrike on the engaged enemy, for the aspect proc. 40 to cast plus 11 kept for Greater Heal.
@setvar! config__use_flamestrike 1
@setvar! config__mana_flamestrike 51

# Self buffs. Reactive Armor and Magic Reflection whenever one is missing. Bless (on yourself) and
# Arch Protection (you and every follower within 6 tiles) after a fight, so they never take a cast
# from Flamestrike. Each start line is the spell cost plus 11 kept for Greater Heal.
@setvar! config__use_reactive_armor 1
@setvar! config__use_magic_reflect 1
@setvar! config__use_bless 1
@setvar! config__use_arch_protection 1
@setvar! config__mana_reactive_armor 15
@setvar! config__mana_magic_reflect 25
@setvar! config__mana_bless 20
@setvar! config__mana_arch_protection 22

# Missing hit points, not percent. light_hits starts the Heal agent, emergency_hits the heal
# potion and Greater Heal. At the emergency line our own casts are cut and new ones wait.
@setvar! config__light_hits 15
@setvar! config__emergency_hits 35
@setvar! config__refresh_stam 15
@setvar! config__mana_heal 4
@setvar! config__mana_cure 6
@setvar! config__mana_greater_heal 11

# The picked enemy is kept while it is on screen (acquire_range) and engaged within
# target_range, as in bard-necro-enhanced.
@setvar! config__target_range 10
@setvar! config__acquire_range 18

# Mushrooms, as in bard-necro-enhanced. Create Food makes them after a fight.
@setvar! config__mushroom_min_count 2
@setvar! config__mushroom_create_mana 70
@setvar! config__mushroom_eat_mana 55

# Over max weight, drop this much gold at your feet per pass.
@setvar! config__use_gold_drop 1
@setvar! config__gold_drop_amount 2000

# Tracking, as in lumberjack-enhanced: startup setup and a Hunting check. Warnings only, no Recall.
# Color: 1 red (murderer), 2 grey (criminal), 3 orange (enemy), 4 all three.
@setvar! config__use_tracking 1
@setvar! config__tracking_color 1
@setvar! config__show_tracking 0

# ####################################################################################
# # WAIT AND COOLDOWN
# ####################################################################################
@setvar! wait__short 200
@setvar! wait__poll 100
@setvar! wait__target 1000

@setvar! cooldown__message 3000
# How long an off screen enemy is kept before it is dropped.
@setvar! cooldown__target_grace 500
@setvar! cooldown__vet_kit 5000
# A Strength or Agility potion is tried once per window. The stat arrives a round trip after the
# drink, and a Curse, Weaken or Clumsy can hold it under the line while the potion still runs:
# without the window that refused drink would go out every pass. An empty bag is looked up at
# the same pace.
@setvar! cooldown__stat_potion 5000
# Reagent read interval, and right after a "More reagents are needed" refusal.
@setvar! cooldown__reagents 30000
# Tracking Hunting check.
@setvar! cooldown__housekeeping 5000
@setvar! cooldown__food 60000

# ####################################################################################
# # TIMER
# ####################################################################################
if not timerexists "timer__message"
    createtimer "timer__message"
endif

if not timerexists "timer__target_grace"
    createtimer "timer__target_grace"
endif

if not timerexists "timer__vet_kit"
    createtimer "timer__vet_kit"
endif

if not timerexists "timer__str_potion"
    createtimer "timer__str_potion"
endif

if not timerexists "timer__agi_potion"
    createtimer "timer__agi_potion"
endif

if not timerexists "timer__reagents"
    createtimer "timer__reagents"
endif

if not timerexists "timer__housekeeping"
    createtimer "timer__housekeeping"
endif

if not timerexists "timer__food"
    createtimer "timer__food"
endif

# Everything starts ready.
settimer "timer__message" cooldown__message
settimer "timer__target_grace" cooldown__target_grace
settimer "timer__vet_kit" cooldown__vet_kit
settimer "timer__str_potion" cooldown__stat_potion
settimer "timer__agi_potion" cooldown__stat_potion
settimer "timer__reagents" cooldown__reagents
settimer "timer__housekeeping" cooldown__housekeeping
settimer "timer__food" cooldown__food

# ####################################################################################
# # STATE
# ####################################################################################
# The enemy picked with lasttarget. Bless and Arch Protection target yourself, which moves
# lasttarget, so Flamestrike and the combat potions read this copy.
if not varexist var__combat_target
    @setvar! var__combat_target 0
endif
# 1 while the remembered enemy is within config__target_range. Recomputed every pass.
@setvar! var__engaged 0

# Reagent flags, written only by REAGENTS. 1 when every reagent of that spell was found.
#   Cure            garlic 3972, ginseng 3973
#   Heal            garlic, ginseng, silk 3981
#   Greater Heal    garlic, ginseng, silk, mandrake 3974
#   Reactive Armor  garlic, silk, ash 3980
#   Reflection      garlic, silk, mandrake
#   Bless           garlic, mandrake
#   Arch Protection garlic, ginseng, mandrake, ash
#   Flamestrike     silk, ash
#   Create Food     garlic, ginseng, mandrake
@setvar! var__has_garlic 0
@setvar! var__has_ginseng 0
@setvar! var__has_mandrake 0
@setvar! var__has_ash 0
@setvar! var__has_silk 0
@setvar! var__regs_cure 0
@setvar! var__regs_heal 0
@setvar! var__regs_greater_heal 0
@setvar! var__regs_reactive_armor 0
@setvar! var__regs_magic_reflect 0
@setvar! var__regs_bless 0
@setvar! var__regs_arch_protection 0
@setvar! var__regs_flamestrike 0
@setvar! var__regs_create_food 0

# Scratch values, each set and read inside one block only.
#   heal_potion_out  HEAL: 1 once a heal potion went out on this pass
#   pet_near         VET KIT: 1 when a picked pet is within config__vet_range
#   fresh_pick       FLAMESTRIKE: 1 when the player picked another enemy during the cast
@setvar! var__heal_potion_out 0
@setvar! var__pet_near 0
@setvar! var__fresh_pick 0

# Tracking, as in lumberjack-enhanced. The color confirmed in this client session survives
# Stop and Play while Hunting stays active.
if not varexist var__tracking_setup_color
    @setvar! var__tracking_setup_color 0
endif
@setvar! var__tracking_filter_confirmed 0
@setvar! var__tracking_hunting_active 0
@setvar! var__tracking_button_answered 0

# ####################################################################################
# # PETS
# ####################################################################################
# Picked once and kept in the profile (conventions 03.C). At Play the pets stand next to you,
# so a stored pet that is not on screen is asked for again (conventions 03.D).
if config__use_vet_kit = 1
    if not varexist global__tamer_pet_1 or not find global__tamer_pet_1 ground -1 -1 18
        overhead "[ pet 1, pick ]" 255
        setvar global__tamer_pet_1
    endif
    if config__pet_count = 2 or config__pet_count = 3
        if not varexist global__tamer_pet_2 or not find global__tamer_pet_2 ground -1 -1 18
            overhead "[ pet 2, pick ]" 255
            setvar global__tamer_pet_2
        endif
    endif
    if config__pet_count = 3
        if not varexist global__tamer_pet_3 or not find global__tamer_pet_3 ground -1 -1 18
            overhead "[ pet 3, pick ]" 255
            setvar global__tamer_pet_3
        endif
    endif
endif

if config__sysmsg = 1
    sysmsg "Tamer mage enhanced v2 loaded: pets={{config__pet_count}}, flamestrike mana={{config__mana_flamestrike}}, tracking color={{config__tracking_color}}." 88
endif
if config__chatty = 1
    overhead "[ tamer, on ]" 290
endif

# ####################################################################################
# # TRACKING SETUP
# ####################################################################################
# Copied from lumberjack-enhanced. Reuse the color verified in this session while Hunting
# stays active. Otherwise check the window and set the color before the loop.
if config__use_tracking = 1 and skill "Tracking" > 0
    if findbuff "tracking" and var__tracking_setup_color = config__tracking_color
        @setvar! var__tracking_filter_confirmed 1
        @setvar! var__tracking_hunting_active 1
    elseif diffhits < config__emergency_hits and not poisoned and not warmode
        if not hidden and not queued and not casting and not targetexists
            useskill "Tracking"
            waitforgump 4267467659 wait__target

            if gumpexists 4267467659
                # Do not cycle past an already correct filter. The window displays the selected type.
                if config__tracking_color = 1 and ingump "Murderer Players" 4267467659
                    @setvar! var__tracking_filter_confirmed 1
                elseif config__tracking_color = 2 and ingump "Criminal Players" 4267467659
                    @setvar! var__tracking_filter_confirmed 1
                elseif config__tracking_color = 3 and ingump "Enemy Players" 4267467659
                    @setvar! var__tracking_filter_confirmed 1
                elseif config__tracking_color = 4 and ingump "All Hostile Players" 4267467659
                    @setvar! var__tracking_filter_confirmed 1
                endif

                if var__tracking_filter_confirmed = 0
                    # An active hunt must stop before cycling through animals and other player colors.
                    if findbuff "tracking"
                        gumpresponse 6 4267467659
                        wait wait__short
                        for 60
                            if not findbuff "tracking"
                                break
                            endif
                            wait wait__poll
                        endfor
                    endif

                    # Discard the old target and old filter replies only while setting up.
                    clearsysmsg
                    if not findbuff "tracking" and gumpexists 4267467659
                        # Button 8 cycles ten hunt filters. Bound the attempt to one complete rotation.
                        for 10
                            if diffhits >= config__emergency_hits or poisoned or warmode or hidden or queued or casting or targetexists
                                break
                            endif
                            if not gumpexists 4267467659
                                break
                            endif
                            gumpresponse 8 4267467659
                            @setvar! var__tracking_button_answered 0
                            # Only one selection is outstanding. Do not outrun a delayed server response.
                            for 60
                                if diffhits >= config__emergency_hits or poisoned or warmode or hidden or queued or casting or targetexists
                                    break
                                endif
                                if config__tracking_color = 1
                                    if insysmsg "You will now hunt murderer players"
                                        @setvar! var__tracking_filter_confirmed 1
                                        @setvar! var__tracking_button_answered 1
                                        break
                                    endif
                                elseif config__tracking_color = 2
                                    if insysmsg "You will now hunt criminal players"
                                        @setvar! var__tracking_filter_confirmed 1
                                        @setvar! var__tracking_button_answered 1
                                        break
                                    endif
                                elseif config__tracking_color = 3
                                    if insysmsg "You will now hunt enemy players"
                                        @setvar! var__tracking_filter_confirmed 1
                                        @setvar! var__tracking_button_answered 1
                                        break
                                    endif
                                elseif config__tracking_color = 4
                                    if insysmsg "You will now hunt all hostile players"
                                        @setvar! var__tracking_filter_confirmed 1
                                        @setvar! var__tracking_button_answered 1
                                        break
                                    endif
                                endif
                                if insysmsg "You will now hunt"
                                    @setvar! var__tracking_button_answered 1
                                    break
                                endif
                                wait wait__poll
                            endfor
                            if var__tracking_filter_confirmed = 1 or var__tracking_button_answered = 0
                                break
                            endif
                        endfor
                    endif
                endif

                if var__tracking_filter_confirmed = 1 and gumpexists 4267467659 and diffhits < config__emergency_hits and not poisoned and not warmode and not hidden and not queued and not casting and not targetexists
                    # Setup reports belong to the old/intermediate filter, never to Recall detection.
                    clearsysmsg
                    if not findbuff "tracking"
                        gumpresponse 6 4267467659
                        wait wait__short
                    endif
                    if findbuff "tracking"
                        @setvar! var__tracking_hunting_active 1
                        @setvar! var__tracking_setup_color config__tracking_color
                    endif
                    if config__show_tracking = 0
                        gumpclose 4267467659
                    endif
                elseif timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
                    overhead "[ track, miss ]" 254
                    settimer "timer__message" 0
                endif
            elseif timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
                overhead "[ track, miss ]" 254
                settimer "timer__message" 0
            endif
        endif
    endif
endif

# ####################################################################################
# # MAIN LOOP
# ####################################################################################
while not dead
    if pvp
        overhead "[ script, blocked ]" 254
        stop
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # REAGENTS
    # ################################################################################
    # First in the pass, so every cast block below reads fresh flags. On the interval, or at
    # once after a refusal for reagents, so a stale flag cannot send the same doomed cast again.
    if timer "timer__reagents" >= cooldown__reagents or insysmsg "More reagents are needed"
        settimer "timer__reagents" 0

        @setvar! var__has_garlic 0
        @setvar! var__has_ginseng 0
        @setvar! var__has_mandrake 0
        @setvar! var__has_ash 0
        @setvar! var__has_silk 0

        if findtype 3972 self
            @setvar! var__has_garlic 1
        endif
        if findtype 3973 self
            @setvar! var__has_ginseng 1
        endif
        if findtype 3974 self
            @setvar! var__has_mandrake 1
        endif
        if findtype 3980 self
            @setvar! var__has_ash 1
        endif
        if findtype 3981 self
            @setvar! var__has_silk 1
        endif

        @setvar! var__regs_cure 0
        @setvar! var__regs_heal 0
        @setvar! var__regs_greater_heal 0
        @setvar! var__regs_reactive_armor 0
        @setvar! var__regs_magic_reflect 0
        @setvar! var__regs_bless 0
        @setvar! var__regs_arch_protection 0
        @setvar! var__regs_flamestrike 0
        @setvar! var__regs_create_food 0

        if var__has_garlic = 1 and var__has_ginseng = 1
            @setvar! var__regs_cure 1
        endif
        if var__has_garlic = 1 and var__has_ginseng = 1 and var__has_silk = 1
            @setvar! var__regs_heal 1
        endif
        if var__has_garlic = 1 and var__has_ginseng = 1 and var__has_silk = 1 and var__has_mandrake = 1
            @setvar! var__regs_greater_heal 1
        endif
        if var__has_garlic = 1 and var__has_silk = 1 and var__has_ash = 1
            @setvar! var__regs_reactive_armor 1
        endif
        if var__has_garlic = 1 and var__has_silk = 1 and var__has_mandrake = 1
            @setvar! var__regs_magic_reflect 1
        endif
        if var__has_garlic = 1 and var__has_mandrake = 1
            @setvar! var__regs_bless 1
        endif
        if var__has_garlic = 1 and var__has_ginseng = 1 and var__has_mandrake = 1 and var__has_ash = 1
            @setvar! var__regs_arch_protection 1
        endif
        if var__has_silk = 1 and var__has_ash = 1
            @setvar! var__regs_flamestrike 1
        endif
        if var__has_garlic = 1 and var__has_ginseng = 1 and var__has_mandrake = 1
            @setvar! var__regs_create_food 1
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # COMBAT TARGET CACHE
    # ################################################################################
    # Same shape as bard-necro-enhanced. The pick is taken up anywhere on screen and engaged
    # inside config__target_range. Bless and Arch Protection target yourself, which moves
    # lasttarget, so this copy is what Flamestrike and the combat potions read.
    if find lasttarget ground -1 -1 config__acquire_range as alias__fresh_target
        if not dead alias__fresh_target and var__combat_target != alias__fresh_target
            if noto alias__fresh_target = "hostile" or noto alias__fresh_target = "criminal" or noto alias__fresh_target = "enemy" or noto alias__fresh_target = "murderer"
                @setvar! var__combat_target alias__fresh_target
                settimer "timer__target_grace" 0
                if config__chatty = 1
                    overhead "[ target, set ]" 1288 var__combat_target
                endif
            endif
        endif
    endif

    @setvar! var__engaged 0
    if var__combat_target = 0
        # No target, nothing to keep.
    elseif find var__combat_target ground -1 -1 config__target_range as alias__stored_target
        settimer "timer__target_grace" 0
        if dead alias__stored_target
            @setvar! var__combat_target 0
        elseif noto alias__stored_target != "hostile" and noto alias__stored_target != "criminal" and noto alias__stored_target != "enemy" and noto alias__stored_target != "murderer"
            @setvar! var__combat_target 0
        else
            @setvar! var__engaged 1
        endif
    elseif find var__combat_target ground -1 -1 config__acquire_range as alias__stored_target
        settimer "timer__target_grace" 0
        if dead alias__stored_target
            @setvar! var__combat_target 0
        endif
    elseif timer "timer__target_grace" >= cooldown__target_grace
        @setvar! var__combat_target 0
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # PARALYZE
    # ################################################################################
    # Nothing else can act while held, so the pouch goes out at once.
    if paralyzed
        if findtype 3705 backpack 38
            yell "[Pouch"
            wait wait__short
        elseif timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
            overhead "[ pouch, out ]" 254
            settimer "timer__message" 0
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # CURE
    # ################################################################################
    # Potion first, it is instant and goes out during a cast. While any cure potion is carried
    # the agent is not used, so mana stays for Greater Heal and Flamestrike.
    if poisoned and not paralyzed and not hidden and not queued and not targetexists
        if config__use_potion = 1 and findtype "Orange Potion" self
            hotkey "Drink Cure"
            wait wait__short
        else
            if config__use_potion = 1 and timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
                overhead "[ cure pot, out ]" 254
                settimer "timer__message" 0
            endif

            if var__regs_cure = 1 and mana >= config__mana_cure and not casting and cooldown "walk" = 0
                hotkey "> Smart Heal/Cure Self"
                wait wait__short

                for 60
                    if not casting
                        break
                    endif
                    if insysmsg "Your concentration is disturbed, thus ruining thy spell."
                        break
                    endif
                    wait wait__poll
                endfor
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # HEAL
    # ################################################################################
    # Light damage takes the Heal agent. Heavy damage drinks first, because the potion is
    # instant, and Greater Heal follows when no potion went out on this pass: none carried, on
    # its own cooldown, or the bar still running. The bar skips the label read while it runs.
    # The label stays authoritative when the bar is missing.
    if not poisoned and not paralyzed and not hidden and not queued and not targetexists and diffhits >= config__light_hits
        @setvar! var__heal_potion_out 0
        if diffhits >= config__emergency_hits and config__use_potion = 1 and cooldown "heal pot" = 0
            if findtype "Yellow Potion" self as alias__heal_potion
                getlabel alias__heal_potion label__heal_potion
                if "next usable" in label__heal_potion
                    # Still on its own cooldown.
                else
                    hotkey "Drink Heal"
                    @setvar! var__heal_potion_out 1
                    wait wait__short
                endif
            elseif timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
                overhead "[ heal pot, out ]" 254
                settimer "timer__message" 0
            endif
        endif

        if var__heal_potion_out = 0 and not casting and cooldown "walk" = 0
            if diffhits >= config__emergency_hits
                if var__regs_greater_heal = 1 and mana >= config__mana_greater_heal
                    hotkey "> Greater Heal/Cure Self"
                    if config__sysmsg = 1
                        sysmsg "Agent: Greater Heal/Cure Self." 88
                    endif
                    wait wait__short

                    for 60
                        if not casting
                            break
                        endif
                        if insysmsg "Your concentration is disturbed, thus ruining thy spell."
                            break
                        endif
                        wait wait__poll
                    endfor
                endif
            elseif var__regs_heal = 1 and mana >= config__mana_heal
                hotkey "> Smart Heal/Cure Self"
                wait wait__short

                for 60
                    if not casting
                        break
                    endif
                    if insysmsg "Your concentration is disturbed, thus ruining thy spell."
                        break
                    endif
                    wait wait__poll
                endfor
            endif

            # An agent leaves its beneficial cursor up when there is nothing left to heal.
            if targetexists "beneficial" and diffhits = 0
                hotkey "Cancel Current Target"
                wait wait__short
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # REFRESH
    # ################################################################################
    if stam <= config__refresh_stam and config__use_potion = 1 and not paralyzed and not hidden and not queued and not targetexists
        if findtype "Red Potion" self
            hotkey "Drink Refresh"
            wait wait__short
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # VET KIT
    # ################################################################################
    # Veterinary supplies (25750), every cooldown__vet_kit while a picked pet is in reach and no
    # bandage time is running. Using them cancels a running bandage, so bandaging gates them.
    # The clock restarts only on a use, so a pet that walks into reach is treated at once.
    if config__use_vet_kit = 1 and not bandaging and not hidden and not queued and not targetexists and timer "timer__vet_kit" >= cooldown__vet_kit
        # A pet skipped with ESC at the pick is never looked up.
        @setvar! var__pet_near 0
        if varexist global__tamer_pet_1
            if find global__tamer_pet_1 ground -1 -1 config__vet_range
                @setvar! var__pet_near 1
            endif
        endif
        if config__pet_count = 2 or config__pet_count = 3
            if varexist global__tamer_pet_2
                if find global__tamer_pet_2 ground -1 -1 config__vet_range
                    @setvar! var__pet_near 1
                endif
            endif
        endif
        if config__pet_count = 3
            if varexist global__tamer_pet_3
                if find global__tamer_pet_3 ground -1 -1 config__vet_range
                    @setvar! var__pet_near 1
                endif
            endif
        endif

        if var__pet_near = 1
            settimer "timer__vet_kit" 0
            if findtype 25750 backpack as alias__vet_kit
                dclick alias__vet_kit
                if config__sysmsg = 1
                    sysmsg "Veterinary supplies used: a pet is within {{config__vet_range}} tiles." 88
                endif
                wait wait__short
            elseif timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
                overhead "[ vet kit, out ]" 254
                settimer "timer__message" 0
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # COMBAT POTIONS
    # ################################################################################
    # Strength, Agility and Magic Resist while an enemy is engaged. Each buff is judged on its
    # own, so running out of one potion does not hold up the others. Strength and Agility read
    # the stat against config__str_potion and config__dex_potion, because Bless shows the same
    # icons as the potions, and each is tried once per cooldown__stat_potion.
    if var__engaged = 1 and config__use_potion = 1 and config__use_stat_potions = 1 and not paralyzed and not hidden and not targetexists
        if not queued and str < config__str_potion and timer "timer__str_potion" >= cooldown__stat_potion
            settimer "timer__str_potion" 0
            if findtype "White Potion" self
                hotkey "Drink Strength"
                wait wait__short
            endif
        endif
        if not queued and dex < config__dex_potion and timer "timer__agi_potion" >= cooldown__stat_potion
            settimer "timer__agi_potion" 0
            if findtype "Blue Potion" self
                hotkey "Drink Agility"
                wait wait__short
            endif
        endif
        if not queued and not findbuff "Magic Resist Potion"
            if findtype "Black Potion" self
                hotkey "Drink Magic Resist"
                wait wait__short
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # SELF BUFFS
    # ################################################################################
    # One cast per pass, in this order:
    #   Reactive Armor, Magic Reflection  whenever missing. The reflect bar is the recast lock
    #   Bless, Arch Protection            after a fight (no remembered enemy, warmode off), once
    #                                     their buff icon is gone. Both open a beneficial cursor
    #                                     that is answered with yourself.
    # Bless shows Strength, Agility and Cunning. Only Cunning is Bless alone, because the
    # Strength and Agility potions show the other two. Arch Protection shows Protection.
    # The icon arrives a round trip after the target, so the block waits for it before the next
    # pass reads it again.
    # Not started at the emergency line, and cut there mid cast so the next pass can heal.
    if not paralyzed and not hidden and not queued and not casting and not targetexists and cooldown "walk" = 0 and diffhits < config__emergency_hits
        if config__use_reactive_armor = 1 and var__regs_reactive_armor = 1 and mana >= config__mana_reactive_armor and not findbuff "Reactive Armor"
            cast "Reactive Armor"
            if config__sysmsg = 1
                sysmsg "Buff: Reactive Armor." 88
            endif
            wait wait__short

            for 60
                if not casting
                    break
                endif
                if insysmsg "Your concentration is disturbed, thus ruining thy spell."
                    break
                endif
                if diffhits >= config__emergency_hits
                    hotkey "> Interrupt"
                    break
                endif
                wait wait__poll
            endfor
        elseif config__use_magic_reflect = 1 and var__regs_magic_reflect = 1 and mana >= config__mana_magic_reflect and cooldown "reflect" = 0 and not findbuff "Magic Reflection"
            cast "Magic Reflection"
            if config__sysmsg = 1
                sysmsg "Buff: Magic Reflection." 88
            endif
            wait wait__short

            for 60
                if not casting
                    break
                endif
                if insysmsg "Your concentration is disturbed, thus ruining thy spell."
                    break
                endif
                if diffhits >= config__emergency_hits
                    hotkey "> Interrupt"
                    break
                endif
                wait wait__poll
            endfor
        elseif config__use_bless = 1 and var__combat_target = 0 and not warmode and var__regs_bless = 1 and mana >= config__mana_bless and not findbuff "Cunning"
            cast "Bless"
            wait wait__short

            for 60
                if targetexists
                    break
                endif
                if insysmsg "Your concentration is disturbed, thus ruining thy spell."
                    break
                endif
                if diffhits >= config__emergency_hits
                    hotkey "> Interrupt"
                    break
                endif
                wait wait__poll
            endfor

            if targetexists "beneficial"
                target self
                if config__sysmsg = 1
                    sysmsg "Buff: Bless on yourself." 88
                endif
                for 10
                    if findbuff "Cunning"
                        break
                    endif
                    wait wait__poll
                endfor
            endif
        elseif config__use_arch_protection = 1 and var__combat_target = 0 and not warmode and var__regs_arch_protection = 1 and mana >= config__mana_arch_protection and not findbuff "Protection"
            cast "Arch Protection"
            wait wait__short

            for 60
                if targetexists
                    break
                endif
                if insysmsg "Your concentration is disturbed, thus ruining thy spell."
                    break
                endif
                if diffhits >= config__emergency_hits
                    hotkey "> Interrupt"
                    break
                endif
                wait wait__poll
            endfor

            if targetexists "beneficial"
                target self
                if config__sysmsg = 1
                    sysmsg "Buff: Arch Protection around yourself." 88
                endif
                for 10
                    if findbuff "Protection"
                        break
                    endif
                    wait wait__poll
                endfor
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # FLAMESTRIKE
    # ################################################################################
    # On the engaged enemy, with warmode off and mana at config__mana_flamestrike. The targeted
    # cast shape of blueprint/razor.html part 4: drain a stale disturbance, cast, poll for the
    # cursor, then read lasttarget once more. If the player picked another enemy during the
    # cast, or the enemy died, the cursor is cancelled and the next pass casts on the new pick.
    if config__use_flamestrike = 1 and var__engaged = 1 and not warmode and var__regs_flamestrike = 1 and mana >= config__mana_flamestrike and diffhits < config__emergency_hits and not paralyzed and not hidden and not queued and not casting and not targetexists and cooldown "walk" = 0
        if find var__combat_target ground -1 -1 config__target_range as alias__fs_target
            if insysmsg "Your concentration is disturbed, thus ruining thy spell."
                # Consumed. A stale disturbance cannot end the poll below early.
            endif
            cast "Flamestrike"
            wait wait__short

            for 60
                if targetexists
                    break
                endif
                if insysmsg "Your concentration is disturbed, thus ruining thy spell."
                    break
                endif
                if diffhits >= config__emergency_hits
                    hotkey "> Interrupt"
                    break
                endif
                wait wait__poll
            endfor

            if targetexists "harmful"
                @setvar! var__fresh_pick 0
                if find lasttarget ground -1 -1 config__acquire_range as alias__fresh_target
                    if not dead alias__fresh_target and var__combat_target != alias__fresh_target
                        if noto alias__fresh_target = "hostile" or noto alias__fresh_target = "criminal" or noto alias__fresh_target = "enemy" or noto alias__fresh_target = "murderer"
                            @setvar! var__fresh_pick 1
                        endif
                    endif
                endif

                if var__fresh_pick = 1 or dead alias__fs_target
                    hotkey "Cancel Current Target"
                    wait wait__short
                else
                    target alias__fs_target
                    if config__sysmsg = 1
                        sysmsg "Flamestrike on {{alias__fs_target}}." 88
                    endif
                    wait wait__short
                endif
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # FOOD AND MUSHROOMS
    # ################################################################################
    if timer "timer__food" >= cooldown__food and not findbuff "Food Satisfaction" and not hidden and not queued and not targetexists
        settimer "timer__food" 0
        if findtype tray backpack as alias__food
            dclick alias__food
            wait wait__short
        endif
    endif

    # Eaten whenever mana is low and the cooldown is over. Made only after a fight, as in
    # bard-necro-enhanced: Create Food returns 25 mana on a 60 second cooldown.
    if mana <= config__mushroom_eat_mana and not findbuff "Magic Mushroom Cooldown" and not hidden and not queued and not targetexists
        if findtype "mushroom" backpack
            hotkey "Eat Magic Mushroom"
            wait wait__short
        endif
    elseif var__combat_target = 0 and not warmode and mana >= config__mushroom_create_mana and var__regs_create_food = 1 and not hidden and not queued and not casting and not targetexists and cooldown "walk" = 0 and counttype "mushroom" backpack < config__mushroom_min_count
        cast "Create Food"
        wait wait__short

        for 60
            if not casting
                break
            endif
            if insysmsg "Your concentration is disturbed, thus ruining thy spell."
                break
            endif
            wait wait__poll
        endfor
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # GOLD
    # ################################################################################
    # One drop per pass, so recovery still runs between drops. A refused drop goes back to the pack.
    if config__use_gold_drop = 1 and weight > maxweight and not hidden and not queued and not casting and not targetexists
        if findtype "gold coin" backpack as alias__found_gold
            lift alias__found_gold config__gold_drop_amount
            droprelloc 0 0
            if config__sysmsg = 1
                sysmsg "Gold drop: up to {{config__gold_drop_amount}} at your feet, weight over max." 88
            endif
            wait wait__short

            if insysmsg "cannot drop anything"
                drop backpack -1 -1 -1
            endif

            wait wait__short
        elseif timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
            overhead "[ weight, over ]" 254
            settimer "timer__message" 0
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # TRACKING CHECK
    # ################################################################################
    # Hunting must stay on for the profile's Tracking overheads to warn. No Recall here.
    if config__use_tracking = 1 and timer "timer__housekeeping" >= cooldown__housekeeping
        settimer "timer__housekeeping" 0
        @setvar! var__tracking_hunting_active 0
        if var__tracking_filter_confirmed = 1 and findbuff "tracking"
            @setvar! var__tracking_hunting_active 1
        endif
        if var__tracking_hunting_active = 0 and timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
            overhead "[ track, check ]" 255
            settimer "timer__message" 0
        endif
    endif

    wait wait__poll
endwhile
